// Rear: twin Cougar-style lenses + chrome bezels, centre gas cap, GT 500 badge
// The '67 GT500's Cougar-style lens, worked out pixel by pixel so the colour, night glow and surface
// relief all line up: a short unlit piece by the gas cap, then three bulb sections split by soft
// moulded seams, small dark pads at each end, and the whole face covered in small staggered pillow
// prisms (the texture that catches the light), with a ribbed lip along the bottom.
